" Chord labels: the chord's name above its column, kept in step with the
" notes by the chord keys (spec [Tablature][[Editing]] 10.9, 10.10), and
" voicings written from a label ([[Annotations]] 10).

Before:
  unlet! b:songwriter_tabmode b:songwriter_slot b:songwriter_typing
  unlet! b:songwriter_insert b:songwriter_voicing b:songwriter_naming b:songwriter_repeat
  let b:songwriter_tabmode = 1

" --- [[Editing]] 10.9 `=` writes the chord label ---

Given songwriter (10.9 =Am writes its label):
  e|-----|
  B|-----|
  G|-----|
  D|-----|
  A|-----|
  E|-----|

Execute (10.9 =Am writes its label):
  call cursor(5, 5)
  execute "normal =Am\<CR>"
  AssertEqual [6, 5], [line('.'), col('.')]

Expect songwriter (10.9 =Am writes its label):
      Am
  e|--0--|
  B|--1--|
  G|--2--|
  D|--2--|
  A|--0--|
  E|-----|

Given songwriter (10.9 =Am replaces the column's chord label):
      G
  e|-----|
  B|-----|
  G|-----|
  D|-----|
  A|-----|
  E|-----|

Execute (10.9 =Am replaces the column's chord label):
