Given songwriter (A10.5 refused off a chord label):
      PM---  riff         Am
  e|-----------|
  B|-----------|
  G|-----------|
  D|-----------|
  A|-----------|
  E|-----------|

Execute (A10.5 refused off a chord label):
  let g:tab = getline(1, '$')
  for col in [5, 12, 10, 25]
    call cursor(1, col)
    redir => g:messages
    silent execute "normal =\<CR>"
    redir END
    Assert g:messages =~# 'songwriter: ', g:messages
    AssertEqual g:tab, getline(1, '$')
  endfor
